      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 122 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Summer Vacation)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I spend my summer vacation a bit different from the winter one."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "During summer vacation,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "my family usually goes on a short trip to visit our relatives."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Last summer vacation, our family went to the seaside"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "next to the East Sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Every holiday, there are major traffic jams,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and it takes a long time to go a very short distance."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It is also very hot for traveling."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even if it is terribly hot during the summer,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I am happy to travel with my family anyways."
    },
